index 07f725c..ab73f4b 100644
--- a/C64DevMachine_win.yyp/datafiles/C64DMResources/LANG/lang_zh_CN.json
+++ b/C64DevMachine_win.yyp/datafiles/C64DMResources/LANG/lang_zh_CN.json
@@ -1922,5 +1922,327 @@
  "SID": "SID",
  "IRQ": "IRQ",
  "MACRO LOADER": "宏 加载器",
- "REU - RAM EXPANSION UNIT": "REU - 内存扩展单元"
+ "REU - RAM EXPANSION UNIT": "REU - 内存扩展单元",
+ "One-stop VIC-II mode setup: text, bitmap, multicolour, ECM and their combinations.": "一站式 VIC-II 模式设置: 文本、位图、多色、ECM 及其组合。",
+ "SETS:": "设置内容:",
+ "Screen, char and bitmap base pointers, the $D011/$D016 mode bits, and the border and background colours, all in one node.": "屏幕、字符集和位图的基址指针, $D011/$D016 模式位, 以及边框和背景颜色, 全部在一个节点内完成。",
+ "WHERE:": "位置:",
+ "Usually the first macro on the spine after INIT. It can also be used for IRQ-based mode changes.": "通常是 INIT 之后主干上的第一个宏。也可用于基于 IRQ 的模式切换。",
+ "Prints text to screen RAM at a given row and column.": "在指定的行和列把文本打印到屏幕 RAM。",
+ "INLINE fixed text, or an ASSET (TEXT_DATA) read through a start/end byte window. Either end of the window can be a literal offset or a named VAR, so the printed slice can shift at runtime - e.g. paging through a longer block of asset text.": "INLINE 固定文本, 或通过起止字节窗口读取的 ASSET (TEXT_DATA)。窗口的任一端都可以是字面偏移或命名 VAR, 因此打印的片段可在运行时移动 - 例如翻页浏览较长的资源文本。",
+ "X / Y / COL:": "X / Y / COL:",
+ "LIT or VAR; old saves default to LIT. VAR X/Y clamp to 39/24. COL sets the single text colour (0-15); a VAR colour uses its low 4 bits.": "LIT 或 VAR; 旧存档默认为 LIT。VAR 的 X/Y 限制在 39/24 以内。COL 设置单一文本颜色 (0-15); VAR 颜色使用其低 4 位。",
+ "ALIGN:": "对齐:",
+ "H/V alignment can auto left/centre/right and top/mid/bottom the text instead of a fixed X/Y. Alignment overrides X/Y; choose DEF for presets.": "H/V 对齐可自动将文本左/中/右以及上/中/下对齐, 代替固定 X/Y。对齐会覆盖 X/Y; 选择 DEF 使用预设。",
+ "PRE-CLEAR:": "预清除:",
+ "Optionally wipes screen RAM before printing.": "可选在打印前清除屏幕 RAM。",
+ "NOTES:": "注意:",
+ "The runtime position also uses ZP $F5-$F8.": "运行时定位还会使用 ZP $F5-$F8。",
+ "Prints a numeric value - a named VAR or a CPU register (A/X/Y/SP/FLAGS) - to screen RAM.": "把数值 - 命名 VAR 或 CPU 寄存器 (A/X/Y/SP/FLAGS) - 打印到屏幕 RAM。",
+ "DEC, HEX, BIN or BCD. FLAGS is always shown in binary with an N V - B D I Z C legend row underneath. Width follows the VAR's own size. Zero or space padding is available.": "DEC、HEX、BIN 或 BCD。FLAGS 始终以二进制显示, 下方附 N V - B D I Z C 图例行。宽度跟随 VAR 自身的大小。可选零填充或空格填充。",
+ "LIT or VAR; old saves default to LIT. VAR X/Y clamp to 39/24; a VAR colour uses its low 4 bits.": "LIT 或 VAR; 旧存档默认为 LIT。VAR 的 X/Y 限制在 39/24 以内; VAR 颜色使用其低 4 位。",
+ "H/V alignment overrides X/Y; choose DEF for presets.": "H/V 对齐会覆盖 X/Y; 选择 DEF 使用预设。",
+ "Writes one screencode, and optionally a colour, at a given row and column of screen and colour RAM.": "在屏幕和颜色 RAM 的指定行列写入一个屏幕码, 并可选写入颜色。",
+ "SET COL:": "设置颜色:",
+ "LIT uses the palette; VAR reads a variable. A variable colour uses its low four bits (0-15).": "LIT 使用调色板; VAR 读取变量。变量颜色使用其低四位 (0-15)。",
+ "HOW IT WORKS:": "工作原理:",
+ "Address maths is shift-add (row*40 = row<<5 + row<<3), so it works against any screen base, not just $0400.": "地址计算采用移位相加 (row*40 = row<<5 + row<<3), 因此适用于任何屏幕基址, 不仅仅是 $0400。",
+ "Reads the screencode, and optionally the colour, at a given row and column into named VARs.": "把指定行列的屏幕码 (以及可选的颜色) 读入命名 VAR。",
+ "The companion read to PLACE CHAR - same pointer maths, opposite direction.": "PLACE CHAR 的配套读取 - 指针计算相同, 方向相反。",
+ "Fills 1000 bytes of screen RAM with a fill byte, starting at a chosen base address.": "从选定的基址开始, 用填充字节填满 1000 字节屏幕 RAM。",
+ "Stops 8 bytes short of the full 1024-byte page so it never touches the sprite pointer table at base+$3F8-$3FF.": "比完整的 1024 字节页少 8 字节, 因此不会触及位于 base+$3F8-$3FF 的精灵指针表。",
+ "Zeroes a rectangular block of bitmap data, given in char-cell col/row/width/height, not pixels.": "把一块矩形位图数据清零, 以字符格的列/行/宽/高给出, 而不是像素。",
+ "RESULT:": "效果:",
+ "Every zeroed bit pair renders as the background colour ($D021) whatever screen and colour RAM hold - a true wipe that doesn't touch either colour plane.": "每个清零的位对都显示为背景色 ($D021), 与屏幕和颜色 RAM 的内容无关 - 真正的擦除, 不触及任何颜色平面。",
+ "COL / ROW / W / H:": "COL / ROW / W / H:",
+ "Each takes an optional byte VAR. With a var set the literal is ignored and the value is read at runtime, so one node can wipe a moving rect (a falling tile, a wipe transition). There is no grid trim in var mode - keep col+w <= 40 and row+h <= 25. A var of 0 for W or H clears nothing.": "每项都可选用一个字节 VAR。设置了变量后会忽略字面值, 在运行时读取数值, 因此一个节点可以擦除移动的矩形 (下落的图块、擦除过渡)。变量模式下不做网格裁剪 - 请保持 col+w <= 40 且 row+h <= 25。W 或 H 的变量为 0 时不清除任何内容。",
+ "TIP:": "提示:",
+ "Drop it before MOVE BMP BLK to pre-clear a room's target area, since MASK00 blending lets old pixels show through any gaps left by a previous room.": "放在 MOVE BMP BLK 之前预先清除房间的目标区域, 因为 MASK00 混合会让上一个房间留下的旧像素从空隙中透出。",
+ "Waits for one specific raster line.": "等待某一条指定的光栅行。",
+ "Gated on the $D011 bit 8 flag so it only fires in the top frame (lines 0-255), never on the phantom repeat in the lower border.": "以 $D011 第 8 位为门控, 因此只在画面上部 (第 0-255 行) 触发, 绝不会在下边框的重复行触发。",
+ "USE:": "用途:",
+ "Syncs code to a precise scanline, e.g. before a raster-split trick.": "把代码同步到精确的扫描线, 例如在光栅分割技巧之前。",
+ "COST:": "开销:",
+ "Exactly 1 byte and 2 cycles per NOP, so a count of 8 costs 8 bytes / 16 cycles. It touches no registers, no ZP and no flags - safe anywhere you need raster or cycle padding.": "每个 NOP 正好 1 字节 2 周期, 所以数量 8 需要 8 字节 / 16 周期。不改动任何寄存器、ZP 和标志 - 可放在任何需要光栅或周期填充的地方。",
+ "Literal only: the run is unrolled at build time, so a variable could not be resolved.": "仅限字面值: 序列在构建时展开, 因此无法解析变量。",
+ "Blocking delay measured in whole frames (PAL 50/s, NTSC 60/s), up to 255 frames (~5.1s PAL).": "以整帧计的阻塞延时 (PAL 50/秒, NTSC 60/秒), 最多 255 帧 (PAL 约 5.1 秒)。",
+ "Counts raster wraps at line 255, gated on $D011 bit 8 so only the top-frame instance is latched.": "在第 255 行计数光栅回绕, 以 $D011 第 8 位为门控, 因此只锁定画面上部的那一次。",
+ "REGISTERS:": "寄存器:",
+ "The counter lives in X - no ZP used. Clobbers A and X.": "计数器保存在 X 中 - 不使用 ZP。会改写 A 和 X。",
+ "Toggles the screen on or off via the DEN bit ($D011 bit 4).": "通过 DEN 位 ($D011 第 4 位) 打开或关闭屏幕。",
+ "A read-modify-write that preserves every other bit in the register, so it is safe alongside VSCROLL, bitmap mode, ECM and the 9th raster bit.": "读-改-写操作, 保留寄存器的其他所有位, 因此可与 VSCROLL、位图模式、ECM 和第 9 光栅位安全共存。",
+ "Fixed 8 bytes.": "固定 8 字节。",
+ "Scrolls a line of inline text across the screen at a chosen row, one character column per call.": "在选定的行上横向滚动一行内联文本, 每次调用移动一个字符列。",
+ "SETTINGS:": "设置:",
+ "Speed, direction, screen row and a working RAM buffer address are all set per node.": "速度、方向、屏幕行和工作 RAM 缓冲区地址都可按节点设置。",
+ "COMMANDS:": "命令:",
+ "_col01, _spd03, _trk02 and _wait can be typed into the text. They are hidden and applied as the scroller meets them.": "可在文本中输入 _col01、_spd03、_trk02 和 _wait。它们不会显示, 在滚动到时生效。",
+ "Points the VIC at a custom character set asset and sets its base address in $D018.": "让 VIC 指向自定义字符集资源, 并在 $D018 中设置其基址。",
+ "Pair it with a MACRO_VIC node for full mode setup - this node only handles the charset pointer.": "请与 MACRO_VIC 节点搭配完成完整的模式设置 - 本节点只处理字符集指针。",
+ "Copies a flat char + colour map asset to screen RAM using a fast (zp),Y pointer-walk loop.": "使用快速的 (zp),Y 指针遍历循环, 把平面字符 + 颜色地图资源复制到屏幕 RAM。",
+ "Map width, height and the destination screen base are all configurable.": "地图宽度、高度和目标屏幕基址均可配置。",
+ "SEE ALSO:": "另见:",
+ "For the tileset-driven flow with per-room stamping, use METAMAP instead.": "如需基于图块集、按房间绘制的流程, 请改用 METAMAP。",
+ "LIT MODE:": "LIT 模式:",
+ "Bakes one chosen room at compile time and copies it to the screen with a MAP-style loop.": "在编译时烘焙选定的一个房间, 并用 MAP 式循环复制到屏幕。",
+ "VAR MODE:": "VAR 模式:",
+ "Every room is compiled as a placement list + stamp table. A runtime stamper reads a named VAR and draws whichever room it points to - re-run the node any time that var changes to redraw.": "每个房间都编译为放置列表 + 图章表。运行时绘制程序读取命名 VAR, 绘制它指向的房间 - 该变量改变时重新运行节点即可重绘。",
+ "Points an existing MACRO_MAP node at a different MAP_DATA asset.": "让现有的 MACRO_MAP 节点指向另一个 MAP_DATA 资源。",
+ "Rewrites its ZP char and colour source pointers, resets the scroll position to zero, and calls the shared map redraw routine.": "改写其 ZP 字符和颜色源指针, 把卷动位置重置为零, 并调用共享的地图重绘例程。",
+ "NEEDS:": "前提:",
+ "A MACRO_MAP node already connected on the spine to read its ZP base from - this node only switches which map that setup points at.": "主干上必须已连接一个 MACRO_MAP 节点以读取其 ZP 基址 - 本节点只切换该设置所指向的地图。",
+ "Horizontal map scrolling with a unified delta core.": "使用统一增量核心的水平地图卷动。",
+ "scroll_fine (0-7) and scrollx (column) are the single source of truth. $D016 is only ever written from scroll_fine, never read back.": "scroll_fine (0-7) 和 scrollx (列) 是唯一的数据来源。$D016 只由 scroll_fine 写入, 从不回读。",
+ "LEFT / RIGHT:": "左 / 右:",
+ "The variants only set the direction sign and share the same scrolling routine.": "两种变体只设置方向符号, 共用同一个卷动例程。",
+ "Draws a HUD panel made in the asset editor and gives you routines to update its fields.": "绘制在资源编辑器中制作的 HUD 面板, 并提供更新其字段的例程。",
+ "SETUP:": "设置:",
+ "Create a HUD asset, paint its panel and add fields in the asset editor. Pick that asset here. Its position and size determine where it appears.": "创建 HUD 资源, 在资源编辑器中绘制面板并添加字段。在此选择该资源。其位置和大小决定它出现的地方。",
+ "SCR / COL:": "SCR / COL:",
+ "Set the destination screen and colour-memory bases (normally $0400 / $D800). COLOUR enables colour writes; turn it off to preserve existing colours.": "设置目标屏幕和颜色内存基址 (通常为 $0400 / $D800)。COLOUR 启用颜色写入; 关闭它可保留现有颜色。",
+ "DRAW:": "绘制:",
+ "AUTO DRAW stamps the panel when execution reaches this macro. With it off, call the hud<ID>_draw routine shown on the node after setting up the screen. Redraw if the panel is overwritten.": "AUTO DRAW 在执行到此宏时绘制面板。关闭时, 请在设置好屏幕后调用节点上显示的 hud<ID>_draw 例程。面板被覆盖后需重绘。",
+ "FIELDS:": "字段:",
+ "For DIGITS or BAR fields, load the value into A, then JSR the field routine shown on the node. DIGITS displays a decimal byte value (0-255); BAR uses the field settings.": "对于 DIGITS 或 BAR 字段, 把数值载入 A, 然后 JSR 节点上显示的字段例程。DIGITS 显示十进制字节值 (0-255); BAR 使用字段设置。",
+ "Text fields mark screen positions, not callable routines. Use the address shown on the node to write your own text.": "文本字段标记屏幕位置, 不是可调用的例程。使用节点上显示的地址写入你自己的文本。",
+ "SCROLLING:": "卷动:",
+ "Reserve HUD rows using the scroller's omit controls. Vertical fine scrolling still moves a character HUD; use a raster split or sprites to keep it steady.": "使用卷动器的省略控制保留 HUD 行。垂直精细卷动仍会移动字符 HUD; 请使用光栅分割或精灵使其保持稳定。",
+ "Four-way smooth scrolling over a META_TILESET room.": "在 META_TILESET 房间上进行四向平滑卷动。",
+ "Pick TILESET and MAP. CLAMP ON stops the camera at the map edges.": "选择 TILESET 和 MAP。CLAMP ON 让镜头停在地图边缘。",
+ "MOVE:": "移动:",
+ "Click MSC_L / MSC_R / MSC_U / MSC_D to create JSR nodes. Each call moves one pixel. Call MSC_Update once EVERY frame, after the movement calls, even when standing still.": "点击 MSC_L / MSC_R / MSC_U / MSC_D 创建 JSR 节点。每次调用移动一个像素。每一帧在移动调用之后调用一次 MSC_Update, 即使静止也要调用。",
+ "Click to cycle through four modes, described below.": "点击可在下列四种模式间循环切换。",
+ "FIXED:": "FIXED:",
+ "Fastest and smallest. One colour-RAM value for the whole room. NIB AUTO chooses the most common value; choose a manual NIB to override it.": "最快且最小。整个房间使用一个颜色 RAM 值。NIB AUTO 选择最常见的值; 手动选择 NIB 可覆盖。",
+ "ROW BANDS:": "ROW BANDS:",
+ "One colour per map row. Useful for sky/ground layouts on a stock C64; horizontal scrolling needs no colour-RAM shift.": "每个地图行一种颜色。适用于原装 C64 上的天空/地面布局; 水平卷动无需移动颜色 RAM。",
+ "SHIFT STOCK:": "SHIFT STOCK:",
+ "Per-character colour on a stock C64 using two screens. Reserve an extra 1K; click BUF to change its address (default $3800). Keep it clear of code, charset and map data.": "在原装 C64 上使用双屏幕实现逐字符颜色。需额外保留 1K; 点击 BUF 更改其地址 (默认 $3800)。避免与代码、字符集和地图数据重叠。",
+ "SHIFT C64U:": "SHIFT C64U:",
+ "Per-character colour for a C64 Ultimate in turbo mode. Too slow for clean scrolling on a stock C64.": "用于加速模式下 C64 Ultimate 的逐字符颜色。在原装 C64 上太慢, 无法流畅卷动。",
+ "PREVIEW:": "预览:",
+ "Use RUN VIEW in the tileset editor to check the selected colour mode. In FIXED, use NIB AUTO or pick a colour from the COLOUR strip.": "在图块集编辑器中使用 RUN VIEW 检查所选的颜色模式。FIXED 模式下, 使用 NIB AUTO 或从 COLOUR 色条中选色。",
+ "SPACE:": "空间:",
+ "PLANES sets the map-data address. ZP BASE reserves 10 zero-page bytes. Check the memory bar for overlaps, including the SHIFT STOCK buffer.": "PLANES 设置地图数据地址。ZP BASE 保留 10 个零页字节。请在内存条中检查重叠, 包括 SHIFT STOCK 缓冲区。",
+ "EDGES / HUD:": "边缘 / HUD:",
+ "BLANK CH must be a blank tile in your charset. OMIT TOP / OMIT BOT remove 0-8 rows each from scrolling, leaving space for a HUD and reducing work.": "BLANK CH 必须是字符集中的空白图块。OMIT TOP / OMIT BOT 各从卷动中去掉 0-8 行, 为 HUD 留出空间并减少工作量。",
+ "PERFORMANCE:": "性能:",
+ "Omitting top rows also gives extra raster time. The LINES estimate turns red when work exceeds the budget; verify timing on your target machine.": "省略顶部行还能获得额外的光栅时间。工作量超出预算时 LINES 估算会变红; 请在目标机器上验证时序。",
+ "LIMITS:": "限制:",
+ "Left/up edges can show a one-pixel pop. Vertical scrolling can pop at an omitted-row seam and also moves a character HUD; use a raster split or sprites for a steady HUD.": "左/上边缘可能出现一个像素的跳动。垂直卷动可能在省略行的接缝处跳动, 并且会移动字符 HUD; 请使用光栅分割或精灵实现稳定的 HUD。",
+ "Vertical scrolling for an 18-column map centred on the 40-column screen (offset 11).": "用于在 40 列屏幕上居中 (偏移 11) 的 18 列地图的垂直卷动。",
+ "WINDOW:": "窗口:",
+ "Scrolls rows 1-22. Rows 0, 23 and 24 are blanked once at init.": "卷动第 1-22 行。第 0、23 和 24 行在初始化时清空一次。",
+ "Chars and colour RAM scroll in lockstep. There are two entry points: one scrolls the content up, the other down.": "字符和颜色 RAM 同步卷动。有两个入口: 一个向上卷动内容, 另一个向下。",
+ "Auto-configures VIC bitmap mode from a Koala or raw bitmap asset.": "根据 Koala 或原始位图资源自动配置 VIC 位图模式。",
+ "The bitmap base and screen base, and loads the asset's screen, colour and bitmap planes.": "位图基址和屏幕基址, 并载入资源的屏幕、颜色和位图平面。",
+ "The simplest way to get a static hi-res or multicolour picture on screen.": "在屏幕上显示静态高分辨率或多色图片的最简单方法。",
+ "Sets up the shared vector-bitmap runtime (interpreter + multicolour plot routine) and streams a VECTOR_BITMAP asset's PLOT / SETCOL / END command list into it.": "设置共享的矢量位图运行时 (解释器 + 多色绘点例程), 并把 VECTOR_BITMAP 资源的 PLOT / SETCOL / END 命令列表送入其中。",
+ "The runtime is emitted once per build, however many VECTOR BMP / PAGE nodes use it.": "无论有多少 VECTOR BMP / PAGE 节点使用, 运行时每次构建只生成一次。",
+ "ORDER:": "顺序:",
+ "Must sit before any VECTOR PAGE nodes that use the same asset.": "必须位于使用同一资源的所有 VECTOR PAGE 节点之前。",
+ "Flips a multi-page VECTOR_BITMAP asset to a chosen page.": "把多页 VECTOR_BITMAP 资源切换到选定的页面。",
+ "Clears the bitmap, fills screen and colour RAM and the border from that page's 4 colours, then renders that page's command stream.": "清除位图, 用该页的 4 种颜色填充屏幕、颜色 RAM 和边框, 然后渲染该页的命令流。",
+ "Doesn't touch the VIC mode registers - the VECTOR BMP setup node earlier on the spine owns those.": "不改动 VIC 模式寄存器 - 由主干上较早的 VECTOR BMP 设置节点负责。",
+ "Copies a rectangular block of bitmap data, in char-cell units, from one bitmap to another or within the same one. It can also copy the matching screen and colour RAM.": "以字符格为单位, 把一块矩形位图数据从一个位图复制到另一个, 或在同一位图内复制。也可同时复制对应的屏幕和颜色 RAM。",
+ "X / Y OFFSET:": "X / Y 偏移:",
+ "Offset VARs (in cells) are added to the source and destination at runtime.": "偏移 VAR (以格为单位) 在运行时加到源和目标上。",
+ "Self-modifying operands keep each row a single fast LDA/STA pair.": "自修改操作数使每一行只需一对快速的 LDA/STA。",
+ "Flips selected sprites horizontally using a lookup table.": "使用查找表水平翻转选定的精灵。",
+ "Reads the sprite data from an asset address, writes the flipped copy to a temp block, and points the sprite pointer table at the flipped copy.": "从资源地址读取精灵数据, 把翻转后的副本写入临时块, 并让精灵指针表指向该副本。",
+ "MODES:": "模式:",
+ "Detects hi-res or multicolour per sprite via $D01C at runtime - both LUTs are emitted inline.": "运行时通过 $D01C 逐个检测精灵为高分辨率或多色 - 两张查找表都内联生成。",
+ "Sets up one hardware sprite: pointer, X/Y position, colour and enable state.": "设置一个硬件精灵: 指针、X/Y 位置、颜色和启用状态。",
+ "Combine it with MOVE, ANIMATE, PRIORITY, ENABLER and the other sprite macros for full behaviour.": "与 MOVE、ANIMATE、PRIORITY、ENABLER 及其他精灵宏组合, 实现完整行为。",
+ "Minimal-byte unison sprite movement: applies a per-frame X/Y delta to a group of sprites (chosen by bitmask), as a literal or a named VAR.": "最少字节的同步精灵移动: 对一组精灵 (由位掩码选择) 每帧施加 X/Y 增量, 可为字面值或命名 VAR。",
+ "Reads the delta as a SIGNED byte. Its sign bit picks the direction at runtime, so one VAR can drive a sprite left/right or up/down just by changing sign - no separate direction flag needed.": "把增量读作有符号字节。其符号位在运行时决定方向, 因此一个 VAR 只需改变符号即可驱动精灵左右或上下移动 - 无需单独的方向标志。",
+ "WRAP / BOUNDED:": "回绕 / 限界:",
+ "By default the position rolls over at the 8-bit edge. Enable STOP to clamp the movement at fixed screen walls instead.": "默认情况下位置在 8 位边界处回绕。启用 STOP 可改为在固定的屏幕边界处停止。",
+ "9TH BIT:": "第 9 位:",
+ "Toggle the $D010 MSB register so X covers the full 0-343 sprite-visible width instead of wrapping at 0-255.": "启用 $D010 MSB 寄存器, 使 X 覆盖完整的 0-343 精灵可见宽度, 而不是在 0-255 回绕。",
+ "Directional / AI seek movement: steers a sprite toward a target X/Y (literal or from named VARs).": "定向 / AI 追踪移动: 把精灵引向目标 X/Y (字面值或命名 VAR)。",
+ "A configurable speed, optional deceleration near the target, and a widening catch box.": "可配置的速度、接近目标时可选的减速, 以及逐渐扩大的捕获框。",
+ "OUTPUT:": "输出:",
+ "Can also report the distance and angle to the target into named VARs for further logic.": "还可把与目标的距离和角度输出到命名 VAR, 供后续逻辑使用。",
+ "Basic sprite-vs-map collision probe.": "基础的精灵与地图碰撞探测。",
+ "Checks the map tile type under a sprite's position and reports a hit / type result into a named VAR.": "检查精灵位置下方的地图图块类型, 并把命中 / 类型结果写入命名 VAR。",
+ "Advanced multi-point collision probe against map tile types, with per-edge and per-corner checks.": "针对地图图块类型的高级多点碰撞探测, 支持逐边和逐角检查。",
+ "DIRECT MODE:": "DIRECT 模式:",
+ "For bitmap hybrids. Reads the screen byte itself as the collision type - the same byte MOVE BMP BLK's WRITE COLL option writes from source tags - so no per-room tile-type table is needed.": "用于位图混合模式。直接把屏幕字节读作碰撞类型 - 与 MOVE BMP BLK 的 WRITE COLL 选项根据源标签写入的字节相同 - 因此无需每个房间的图块类型表。",
+ "SCAN MODE:": "SCAN 模式:",
+ "For char maps. Looks the screen byte up in the map's generated <map>_TILE_TYPES table instead.": "用于字符地图。改为在地图生成的 <map>_TILE_TYPES 表中查找屏幕字节。",
+ "Sets whether a sprite draws in front of or behind the background characters.": "设置精灵绘制在背景字符的前面还是后面。",
+ "REGISTER:": "寄存器:",
+ "$D01B.": "$D01B。",
+ "Turns a hardware sprite on or off.": "打开或关闭一个硬件精灵。",
+ "$D015 - a clean single-purpose toggle rather than hand-rolling the bitmask each time.": "$D015 - 简洁的单一用途开关, 无需每次手写位掩码。",
+ "Toggles X and/or Y double-size expansion for a sprite.": "切换精灵的 X 和/或 Y 双倍尺寸扩展。",
+ "$D01D for X, $D017 for Y.": "X 为 $D01D, Y 为 $D017。",
+ "Hides sprites behind foreground parts of the scene. JSR <alias>_sub once per frame, after moving and animating. With nothing masked under the sprite, its real frames come back.": "把精灵隐藏在场景前景部分的后面。每帧在移动和动画之后 JSR <alias>_sub 一次。精灵下方没有遮罩时, 恢复其原始帧。",
+ "A SPRITE_MASK asset for one fixed scene, or a ROOM_MAP to use the current room's mask (ROOMS fetches it into its MASK RAM).": "用于单一固定场景的 SPRITE_MASK 资源, 或使用当前房间遮罩的 ROOM_MAP (ROOMS 会把它取到其 MASK RAM 中)。",
+ "Slots to mask, e.g. 0 or 0,1. The first slot's position decides where the mask is read.": "要遮罩的槽位, 例如 0 或 0,1。第一个槽位的位置决定读取遮罩的位置。",
+ "HOT Y:": "HOT Y:",
+ "The feet row inside the sprite (0-20). A cell painted with a Y line hides the sprite only while the feet are above that line. At or below it the sprite is in front.": "精灵内部的脚部行 (0-20)。绘有 Y 线的格子只在脚部位于该线上方时隐藏精灵。在线上或线下时精灵位于前面。",
+ "WORK:": "工作区:",
+ "64-byte aligned address for the masked copies: 2 x 64 bytes per slot, in the sprites' VIC bank, not used by anything else.": "存放遮罩副本的 64 字节对齐地址: 每个槽位 2 x 64 字节, 位于精灵的 VIC 存储体中, 且不被其他内容使用。",
+ "ZP:": "ZP:",
+ "First of the 12 zero page bytes it borrows. They are saved and restored on every call.": "借用的 12 个零页字节中的第一个。每次调用都会保存并恢复它们。",
+ "SYNC:": "同步:",
+ "OFF: the frame swaps when the routine ends, often mid-screen, so the mask can trail the sprite by a frame - a shimmer while it moves.": "OFF: 帧在例程结束时切换, 通常在屏幕中途, 因此遮罩可能落后精灵一帧 - 移动时会闪烁。",
+ "ON: position and masked frame change together on line $FB. Use it for anything that moves. It waits for that line itself, so remove the loop's VWAIT.": "ON: 位置和遮罩帧在第 $FB 行同时改变。凡是移动的对象都应使用。它自己会等待该行, 因此请移除循环中的 VWAIT。",
+ "MC sprite over an MC bitmap: keep X even (move in steps of 2) or the mask edge flickers by a pixel.": "多色精灵叠在多色位图上: 保持 X 为偶数 (以 2 为步长移动), 否则遮罩边缘会闪烁一个像素。",
+ "Tests one point against a LINE_COLL asset's lines and puts the TYPE (1-7) of the first line hit in RES, or 0 for no hit. It only reports - your nodes decide what a hit does (e.g. IF BYTE RES <> 0: put the old position back).": "用一个点测试 LINE_COLL 资源中的线条, 把第一条命中线的 TYPE (1-7) 写入 RES, 未命中则为 0。它只负责报告 - 由你的节点决定命中后做什么 (例如 IF BYTE RES <> 0 时恢复旧位置)。",
+ "LUT:": "LUT:",
+ "The LINE_COLL asset, or a ROOM_MAP to use the current room's lines.": "LINE_COLL 资源, 或使用当前房间线条的 ROOM_MAP。",
+ "PX / PY:": "PX / PY:",
+ "Vars holding the point. HW_SPR0_X / HW_SPR0_Y read the sprite directly.": "保存该点的变量。HW_SPR0_X / HW_SPR0_Y 直接读取精灵。",
+ "OFF X / OFF Y:": "OFF X / OFF Y:",
+ "Optional signed offset vars added first, to move the point to the feet: -12 / -30 is a sprite's bottom centre on the bitmap.": "可选的有符号偏移变量, 先行相加, 把点移到脚部: -12 / -30 是精灵在位图上的底部中心。",
+ "RES VAR:": "RES 变量:",
+ "Var that receives the line type.": "接收线条类型的变量。",
+ "THICK:": "厚度:",
+ "EXACT: the point must land on the line. +/-1 to 3: that many units either side also count, so fast or diagonal moves can't slip through. Line ends stay exact.": "EXACT: 点必须落在线上。+/-1 到 3: 两侧相应单位内也算命中, 因此快速或斜向移动不会穿过。线条端点仍为精确判定。",
+ "WIDE X:": "WIDE X:",
+ "Set on the LINE_COLL asset. One X unit = 2 pixels so lines cover all 320. With a sprite X register as PX the 9th X bit is included.": "在 LINE_COLL 资源上设置。一个 X 单位 = 2 像素, 使线条覆盖全部 320。以精灵 X 寄存器作为 PX 时会包含第 9 个 X 位。",
+ "Check after every 1-pixel step (after each MOVE) so a diagonal can't cross a line between pixels. Uses ZP $F3-$FE as scratch, not restored.": "每移动 1 像素 (每次 MOVE 之后) 检查一次, 以免斜向移动在像素之间穿过线条。使用 ZP $F3-$FE 作为暂存, 不会恢复。",
+ "Loads the rooms of a ROOM_MAP asset (made in the asset panel's map view) and routes doors between them.": "载入 ROOM_MAP 资源 (在资源面板的地图视图中制作) 的房间, 并在房间之间连接门。",
+ "ROOM:": "ROOM:",
+ "The byte holding the current room number.": "保存当前房间号的字节。",
+ "Player sprite slots moved to the arrival points, e.g. 0,1.": "移动到到达点的玩家精灵槽位, 例如 0,1。",
+ "HOT X / Y:": "HOT X / Y:",
+ "The player's hotspot inside the sprite - the map's points are that pixel.": "精灵内部的玩家热点 - 地图上的点即对应该像素。",
+ "HOOK:": "HOOK:",
+ "Optional label called after each room loads.": "每个房间载入后调用的可选标签。",
+ "ROUTINES:": "例程:",
+ "RM_<MAP>_start enters ROOM at its spawn point. RM_<MAP>_door takes A = the collider line type (2-7). RM_<MAP>_enter reloads ROOM at the last arrival point.": "RM_<MAP>_start 在出生点进入 ROOM。RM_<MAP>_door 以 A = 碰撞线类型 (2-7) 调用。RM_<MAP>_enter 在上一个到达点重新载入 ROOM。",
+ "Point a COLL_LINE at the ROOM_MAP to probe whichever room is current.": "让 COLL_LINE 指向 ROOM_MAP, 即可探测当前所在的房间。",
+ "One player controls several named animation sequences. Each numbered row is a sequence, such as DOWN, RIGHT or LEAP. The frame lists beneath it describe the sprites to show at each animation step.": "一个播放器控制多个命名动画序列。每个编号行是一个序列, 例如 DOWN、RIGHT 或 LEAP。其下方的帧列表描述每个动画步骤要显示的精灵。",
+ "EDIT / ASSET:": "EDIT / ASSET:",
+ "[EDIT] opens the linked reusable ANIMATION asset. On a local node, it creates an asset from the existing sequences. Click ASSET beneath the rows to cycle through available animation assets or return to local data. Linked rows are edited in the asset editor; SELECT and ALIAS remain local to each node.": "[EDIT] 打开链接的可复用 ANIMATION 资源。在本地节点上, 它会根据现有序列创建资源。点击行下方的 ASSET 可在可用动画资源间循环, 或返回本地数据。链接的行在资源编辑器中编辑; SELECT 和 ALIAS 仍属于各个节点本地。",
+ "How many hardware sprite slots have frame lists shown, from slot 0 upwards (1-8). It is NOT the number of frames or directions. For the layered CityCat, use 2: slot 0 is the outline and slot 1 is the colour layer. Four slots would give four sprite layers if you position them together. Slots can also animate separate sprites.": "显示帧列表的硬件精灵槽位数量, 从槽位 0 开始 (1-8)。它不是帧数或方向数。对于分层的 CityCat, 使用 2: 槽位 0 是轮廓, 槽位 1 是颜色层。若把四个槽位放在一起, 就得到四个精灵层。槽位也可以为各自独立的精灵播放动画。",
+ "FRAME LISTS:": "帧列表:",
+ "The left box is slot 0, the next is slot 1, and so on. Enter sprite indices from the loaded sprite bank, separated by commas. The lists advance together: first entry with first entry, second with second, etc. These are sprite indices, not screen positions or memory addresses.": "左边的框是槽位 0, 下一个是槽位 1, 依此类推。输入已载入精灵库中的精灵索引, 用逗号分隔。各列表同步推进: 第一项对第一项, 第二项对第二项, 等等。这些是精灵索引, 不是屏幕位置或内存地址。",
+ "EXAMPLE:": "示例:",
+ "CityCat DOWN: outline (left) = 0,12,24,36. Colour (right) = 6,18,30,42. The four displayed pairs are (0 + 6), (12 + 18), (24 + 30), then (36 + 42). This matches the packed 48-sprite runtime bank in the example; use the indices of the bank actually loaded, not a differently arranged source sheet.": "CityCat DOWN: 轮廓 (左) = 0,12,24,36。颜色 (右) = 6,18,30,42。显示的四对依次为 (0 + 6)、(12 + 18)、(24 + 30)、(36 + 42)。这与示例中打包的 48 精灵运行时库一致; 请使用实际载入的库的索引, 而不是排列不同的源图。",
+ "Player calls per animation step (1-255). Call the player once per game frame: lower delay is faster. DELAY 8 holds each step for 8 game frames, about 0.16 seconds at 50 Hz PAL. It is shared by all layers in that row.": "每个动画步骤的播放器调用次数 (1-255)。每个游戏帧调用一次播放器: 延迟越小越快。DELAY 8 让每步保持 8 个游戏帧, 在 50 Hz PAL 下约 0.16 秒。该行所有层共用此值。",
+ "On (green) repeats the row. Off plays once, holds the final frame, then sets <alias>_done to 1. Keep layer lists the same length for paired artwork. A shorter list repeats within a looping row, or holds its last entry in a one-shot row.": "开 (绿色) 时重复该行。关时播放一次, 停在最后一帧, 然后把 <alias>_done 设为 1。成对的美术图层请保持列表长度一致。较短的列表在循环行中会重复, 在单次行中会停在最后一项。",
+ "SELECT:": "SELECT:",
+ "The address or variable containing the row number: 0 selects DOWN in this example, 1 selects DOWN_RIGHT, etc. Blank SELECT always chooses row 0. Changing the value restarts the newly selected row. An out-of-range value pauses updates; it does not hide the sprites.": "包含行号的地址或变量: 在此示例中 0 选择 DOWN, 1 选择 DOWN_RIGHT, 等等。SELECT 为空时始终选择第 0 行。改变数值会重新开始新选中的行。超出范围的值会暂停更新, 但不会隐藏精灵。",
+ "Names the callable player, for example cc_anim. Call JSR cc_anim_sub once per game frame. JSR cc_anim_reset restarts the selected row on the next player call. Read cc_anim_done for one-shot completion. Row names are descriptions; SELECT uses their numbered positions.": "为可调用的播放器命名, 例如 cc_anim。每个游戏帧调用一次 JSR cc_anim_sub。JSR cc_anim_reset 会在下一次播放器调用时重新开始所选行。读取 cc_anim_done 判断单次播放是否完成。行名只是描述; SELECT 使用其编号位置。",
+ "Use connected SPRITE nodes in the same ORG to configure the hardware slots, position, colours and hires/multicolour mode. Put the two CityCat slots at the same X/Y to align the layers. ANIM SET changes sprite pointers only; it does not position, mirror or move the cat. Its shared bank base comes from the connected slot-0 SPRITE asset.": "使用同一 ORG 中连接的 SPRITE 节点配置硬件槽位、位置、颜色以及高分辨率/多色模式。把两个 CityCat 槽位放在相同的 X/Y 以对齐图层。ANIM SET 只改变精灵指针; 不负责定位、镜像或移动猫。其共享库基址来自连接的槽位 0 SPRITE 资源。",
+ "Up to 32 rows and 255 animation steps across the set (count each row by its longest layer list, not the sum of its layers). SLOTS controls the visible boxes; reducing it does not clear hidden frame lists. Clear an unwanted list before hiding its slot. X deletes a sequence and renumbers the rows below it, so check SELECT values afterwards.": "整套最多 32 行和 255 个动画步骤 (每行按其最长的图层列表计算, 而不是各层之和)。SLOTS 控制可见的框; 减少它不会清除隐藏的帧列表。隐藏槽位前请先清除不需要的列表。X 会删除序列并重新编号其下方的行, 之后请检查 SELECT 值。",
+ "Per-sprite-slot animation: up to 8 slots, each with its own list of frame values and X/Y position offsets (+/-) to step through over time.": "按精灵槽位的动画: 最多 8 个槽位, 每个都有自己的帧值列表和 X/Y 位置偏移 (+/-), 随时间逐步播放。",
+ "Place the node once before your core game loop. It exposes a JSR entry point that then appears in the picker on any JSR node, so the per-frame advance is called from wherever your loop needs it.": "在核心游戏循环之前放置一次该节点。它会提供一个 JSR 入口, 该入口随后出现在任何 JSR 节点的选择器中, 因此可在循环中任何需要的位置调用每帧推进。",
+ "A frame counter, not a speed value: a lower DELAY advances sooner, so lower = faster animation.": "这是帧计数器, 不是速度值: DELAY 越小推进越早, 所以越小动画越快。",
+ "Direct CIA1 matrix scan: a column is driven low on $DC00 and the rows are read back from $DC01, so any number of keys can be held at once.": "直接扫描 CIA1 键盘矩阵: 在 $DC00 上拉低一列, 再从 $DC01 读回各行, 因此可以同时按住任意数量的按键。",
+ "BITS:": "位:",
+ "Each enabled key sets its own bit in the ZP block and can JSR a label. Bit 0 is the first key in the grid, reading left to right.": "每个启用的按键在 ZP 块中设置自己的位, 并可 JSR 一个标签。第 0 位是网格中的第一个键, 从左到右读取。",
+ "NOT SCANNABLE:": "无法扫描:",
+ "RESTORE (it is on the NMI line), and F2/F4/F6/F8 (these are SHIFT plus F1/F3/F5/F7, not matrix positions).": "RESTORE (位于 NMI 线上), 以及 F2/F4/F6/F8 (它们是 SHIFT 加 F1/F3/F5/F7, 不是矩阵位置)。",
+ "CURSOR KEYS:": "光标键:",
+ "KUP/KDN/KLF/KRT are the cursor DIRECTIONS: the CRSR key with the shift test built in (KUP = CRSR U/D + shift, KDN = CRSR U/D with no shift, and so on).": "KUP/KDN/KLF/KRT 是光标方向: 内置 SHIFT 判断的 CRSR 键 (KUP = CRSR U/D + SHIFT, KDN = 不带 SHIFT 的 CRSR U/D, 依此类推)。",
+ "Reads a Commodore 1351 in proportional mode. POTX/POTY give a 6-bit delta each frame, which is sign-extended and added to a signed 16-bit X/Y held in zero page.": "以比例模式读取 Commodore 1351。POTX/POTY 每帧给出 6 位增量, 经符号扩展后加到保存在零页中的有符号 16 位 X/Y 上。",
+ "Names a 7 byte block: +2/+3 is X, +4/+5 is Y - those are the addresses your own code reads.": "指定一个 7 字节块: +2/+3 是 X, +4/+5 是 Y - 这些就是你自己的代码要读取的地址。",
+ "LF / RT / UP / DN:": "LF / RT / UP / DN:",
+ "Fire once per frame while the mouse is moving on that axis. They are a movement report, not a held direction like the joystick's.": "鼠标在该轴上移动时每帧触发一次。它们是移动报告, 不是像摇杆那样的按住方向。",
+ "Call this once per frame. Reading the pots needs CIA1 $DC00 bits 6-7 pointed at the port, which the KERNAL keyboard scan also writes.": "每帧调用一次。读取电位器需要让 CIA1 $DC00 的第 6-7 位指向该端口, 而 KERNAL 键盘扫描也会写入这两位。",
+ "Reads a CIA joystick port and dispatches to JMP targets based on which direction and fire bits are set, via an AND/BNE test per bit.": "读取 CIA 摇杆端口, 根据设置了哪些方向位和开火位, 通过每位一次 AND/BNE 测试分派到 JMP 目标。",
+ "Connect JMP-target nodes for whichever directions or fire button you want to react to.": "为你想要响应的方向或开火按钮连接 JMP 目标节点。",
+ "Full SID music setup with a raster IRQ: configures the player, hooks a raster interrupt, and starts playback of an imported SID_MUSIC or SID_SFX asset.": "带光栅 IRQ 的完整 SID 音乐设置: 配置播放器, 挂接光栅中断, 并开始播放导入的 SID_MUSIC 或 SID_SFX 资源。",
+ "For the built-in MUSIC_MAKER tool instead of an imported .sid file - with multi-song support, hard restart and tempo control - use SID SONG.": "如需使用内置的 MUSIC_MAKER 工具代替导入的 .sid 文件 - 支持多首歌曲、硬重启和速度控制 - 请使用 SID SONG。",
+ "Multi-song player driven by the built-in MUSIC_MAKER tool (an asset you compose songs in), with hard-restart support, per-asset tempo, and a write-only SID register shadow so playback never read-modify-writes $D400-$D41C.": "由内置 MUSIC_MAKER 工具 (用于作曲的资源) 驱动的多歌曲播放器, 支持硬重启、按资源设置速度, 并使用只写的 SID 寄存器影子, 因此播放时从不对 $D400-$D41C 进行读-改-写。",
+ "MEMORY:": "内存:",
+ "Banks BASIC ROM out permanently at init ($01=$36), keeping the KERNAL in so $0314/$0315 IRQ chaining still works, and frees $03-$8F for player state.": "初始化时永久切出 BASIC ROM ($01=$36), 保留 KERNAL 以便 $0314/$0315 IRQ 链接仍可工作, 并释放 $03-$8F 供播放器状态使用。",
+ "PATTERNS:": "音型:",
+ "$FF = REST (gate off, the tail still runs), $FE = HOLD (the ringing note continues), 0-95 = chromatic note index.": "$FF = 休止 (门关闭, 尾音仍在运行), $FE = 保持 (正在发声的音符继续), 0-95 = 半音音符索引。",
+ "Plays a single note or sound on a chosen SID voice. Waveform, frequency, ADSR and pulse width can each be a literal or a named VAR.": "在选定的 SID 声部上播放单个音符或声音。波形、频率、ADSR 和脉宽都可以是字面值或命名 VAR。",
+ "$D404 carries both the waveform bits and the gate bit, and is always written last so the note gates on only once everything else is set.": "$D404 同时包含波形位和门位, 并总是最后写入, 确保其他一切设置好之后音符才开启。",
+ "NOTE LIST:": "音符列表:",
+ "The note can also come from a TEXT_DATA asset acting as a note list, indexed at runtime.": "音符也可以来自作为音符列表的 TEXT_DATA 资源, 在运行时索引。",
+ "Choose SFX MAKER for native effects, or SFX DATA for the existing GoatTracker/Zed import workflow.": "选择 SFX MAKER 使用原生音效, 或选择 SFX DATA 使用现有的 GoatTracker/Zed 导入流程。",
+ "SFX MAKER:": "SFX MAKER:",
+ "Pick an effect and SID voice, then click ACTION to choose PLAY, UPDATE, STOP or INIT. Use the same asset and voice on all those nodes.": "选择音效和 SID 声部, 然后点击 ACTION 选择 PLAY、UPDATE、STOP 或 INIT。所有这些节点请使用相同的资源和声部。",
+ "ACTIONS:": "动作:",
+ "INIT once before music starts sets the volume and clears this effect voice. UPDATE runs once per video frame. PLAY triggers once on your game event; STOP cancels.": "在音乐开始前执行一次 INIT, 设置音量并清空该音效声部。UPDATE 每视频帧运行一次。PLAY 在游戏事件发生时触发一次; STOP 取消。",
+ "WITH MUSIC:": "与音乐共用:",
+ "In Music Maker, turn OFF that voice with VOICES. Example: music on 1+2, effects on 3. Song position and memory banking are untouched by SFX calls.": "在 Music Maker 中用 VOICES 关闭该声部。例如: 音乐用 1+2, 音效用 3。SFX 调用不会影响歌曲位置和内存分页。",
+ "PRIORITY:": "优先级:",
+ "Higher priority interrupts; equal priority restarts. Lower priority waits for your next trigger. Imported SFX DATA keeps its existing SID player path.": "较高优先级会打断; 相同优先级会重新开始。较低优先级等待下一次触发。导入的 SFX DATA 保持其现有的 SID 播放器路径。",
+ "Runtime music track switcher: polls GETIN each frame and swaps to a different SID or track on input.": "运行时音乐曲目切换器: 每帧轮询 GETIN, 有输入时切换到另一首 SID 或曲目。",
+ "SAFETY:": "安全:",
+ "SEI/CLI guards stop an IRQ firing mid-init or mid-GETIN.": "SEI/CLI 保护可防止 IRQ 在初始化或 GETIN 期间触发。",
+ "sid_getin must resolve to $FFE4 at build time.": "构建时 sid_getin 必须解析为 $FFE4。",
+ "Stops and restarts the music tick. PAUSE sets a flag that every SID play call is guarded by, so the IRQ keeps firing - raster splits and everything else in the handler are untouched - and only the music stops advancing.": "停止和重新启动音乐节拍。PAUSE 设置一个标志, 每次 SID 播放调用都受其保护, 因此 IRQ 继续触发 - 光栅分割和处理程序中的其他一切都不受影响 - 只有音乐停止推进。",
+ "Hands all three SID voices to whatever you want them for: VOI64 speech, sound effects, a jingle. RESUME gives them straight back.": "把三个 SID 声部全部交给你需要的用途: VOI64 语音、音效、短曲。RESUME 会立即交还。",
+ "PAUSE:": "暂停:",
+ "Also silences the three voices, because a note with a long release would otherwise drone on underneath.": "同时会让三个声部静音, 否则释放时间较长的音符会在下面持续嗡鸣。",
+ "RESUME:": "恢复:",
+ "Nothing needs restoring: SID players rewrite the whole register set every frame, so the first tick after puts the chip back. The tune continues from where it paused rather than restarting - its counters live in RAM and were never touched.": "无需恢复任何内容: SID 播放器每帧都会重写整组寄存器, 所以之后的第一个节拍就会让芯片复原。乐曲从暂停处继续而不是重新开始 - 其计数器保存在 RAM 中, 从未被改动。",
+ "Nothing unless used: with no SID PAUSE node in the project the guards are not emitted at all.": "不使用就没有开销: 项目中没有 SID PAUSE 节点时, 根本不会生成这些保护代码。",
+ "Sets the SID up for speech and emits the Voi64 player once. Every VOI64 SAY in the project needs one of these connected - without it a SAY emits nothing.": "为语音设置 SID, 并生成一次 Voi64 播放器。项目中每个 VOI64 SAY 都需要连接一个它 - 没有它, SAY 不会生成任何内容。",
+ "The glottal rate in Hz.": "声门频率, 单位 Hz。",
+ "THROAT / MOUTH:": "THROAT / MOUTH:",
+ "THROAT scales the first formant (deeper, chestier). MOUTH scales the second and third (brighter, more forward).": "THROAT 缩放第一共振峰 (更低沉、更浑厚)。MOUTH 缩放第二和第三共振峰 (更明亮、更靠前)。",
+ "0-255 with 128 nominal. HIGHER IS FASTER.": "0-255, 128 为标准。数值越大越快。",
+ "BLOCKING:": "阻塞:",
+ "The player owns the CPU until the phrase ends, so no raster effects and no music while it speaks.": "播放器在短语结束前独占 CPU, 因此说话时没有光栅效果, 也没有音乐。",
+ "VOICES:": "声部:",
+ "V3 is a silent pitch source, V1 is the first formant hard-synced to it, V2 is the second. On unvoiced sounds V3 switches to noise and carries the frication.": "V3 是静音的音高源, V1 是与之硬同步的第一共振峰, V2 是第二共振峰。发清音时 V3 切换为噪声并承担摩擦音。",
+ "Speaks a phrase.": "说出一个短语。",
+ "TEXT / PHONEME:": "TEXT / PHONEME:",
+ "TEXT mode runs English letter-to-sound on the PC at build time, so the C64 never sees a letter - only the finished frames. PHONEME mode takes a phoneme string verbatim, which is how you fix a word the rules get wrong.": "TEXT 模式在构建时于 PC 上执行英文字母到语音的转换, 因此 C64 从不接触字母 - 只得到最终的帧。PHONEME 模式按原样接受音素字符串, 用来修正规则读错的单词。",
+ "Typed inline or a TEXT_DATA asset. Both are known at build time, which is what keeps the runtime cost to eight bytes per glottal period.": "内联输入或 TEXT_DATA 资源。两者在构建时都已知, 因此运行时开销保持在每个声门周期八字节。",
+ "LINE FROM / TO:": "LINE FROM / TO:",
+ "In TEXT DATA mode these pick a slice of the asset - one phrase per line, so a single asset becomes a phrase bank several SAY nodes share. Leave both blank for the whole thing. Lines rather than the byte offsets PRINT uses: the asset never reaches the C64, so a byte range would only let you cut a word in half.": "在 TEXT DATA 模式下用于选取资源的一部分 - 每行一个短语, 因此单个资源可成为多个 SAY 节点共享的短语库。两项都留空则使用全部内容。使用行而不是 PRINT 所用的字节偏移: 资源从不进入 C64, 字节范围只会把单词切成两半。",
+ "VAR RANGE:": "变量范围:",
+ "Either end can be a byte VAR instead of a number, so the program picks its line at runtime - set the var, call the macro. Line 1-255.": "任一端都可以是字节 VAR 而不是数字, 让程序在运行时选择行 - 设置变量, 调用宏。行号 1-255。",
+ "A var-driven SAY compiles EVERY line of the asset and indexes them through a pointer table, because the range is not known until the program runs. A fixed range compiles only the lines it names.": "由变量驱动的 SAY 会编译资源的每一行, 并通过指针表索引, 因为范围要到程序运行时才知道。固定范围只编译其指定的行。",
+ "OVERRIDES:": "覆盖:",
+ "PITCH / SPEED / THROAT / MOUTH show a dash when they are inherited from the master. Type a value to override it for this phrase only.": "PITCH / SPEED / THROAT / MOUTH 显示短横线时表示继承自主节点。输入数值可仅对此短语覆盖。",
+ "PREVIEW VOICE plays it through the tool using the same phoneme string the build will emit.": "PREVIEW VOICE 使用构建时将生成的同一音素字符串, 在工具中播放。",
+ "Random numbers from the SID voice-3 noise generator.": "来自 SID 第 3 声部噪声发生器的随机数。",
+ "Optionally sets the oscillator up once, reads $D41B, and can clamp the result branchlessly into a [MIN,MAX] range.": "可选地设置一次振荡器, 读取 $D41B, 并可无分支地把结果限制在 [MIN,MAX] 范围内。",
+ "Left in A and/or stored to a named VAR.": "保留在 A 中和/或存入命名 VAR。",
+ "ADD / SUB / MUL / DIV / ONE-MINUS / INVERT-SIGN on named VARs, signed two's complement throughout.": "对命名 VAR 进行 ADD / SUB / MUL / DIV / ONE-MINUS / INVERT-SIGN 运算, 全程使用有符号补码。",
+ "WIDTH:": "宽度:",
+ "Each operand's width follows its own VAR meta (byte or word).": "每个操作数的宽度跟随其 VAR 元数据 (字节或字)。",
+ "CODE:": "代码:",
+ "ADD / SUB / ONEMINUS / INVSIGN are inlined. MUL / DIV call a shared math_mul16 / math_div16 routine emitted once per build.": "ADD / SUB / ONEMINUS / INVSIGN 内联生成。MUL / DIV 调用每次构建只生成一次的共享 math_mul16 / math_div16 例程。",
+ "Works in $F2-$F8, chosen to avoid the MACRO_MAP reservation ($FB-$FE) and the vector-bmp scratch.": "工作区为 $F2-$F8, 以避开 MACRO_MAP 的保留区 ($FB-$FE) 和矢量位图暂存区。",
+ "Asks a 1541 Ultimate / Ultimate 64 to load a .reu image from its OWN storage into REU memory.": "让 1541 Ultimate / Ultimate 64 从其自身存储中把 .reu 映像载入 REU 内存。",
+ "WHEN:": "使用场合:",
+ "For a PRG run from the Ultimate's file browser, with no PC involved. VICE gets its image on the command line instead, and F6 pushes one over the network - this node does nothing under emulation.": "用于从 Ultimate 文件浏览器运行、无需 PC 参与的 PRG。VICE 改为通过命令行获得映像, F6 则通过网络推送 - 在模拟器下此节点不执行任何操作。",
+ "Follows the chosen LOAD_REU asset unless you type an override, so a rename cannot leave it pointing at a file that is no longer written.": "跟随所选的 LOAD_REU 资源, 除非你输入覆盖值, 因此重命名不会让它指向不再写出的文件。",
+ "STAT:": "STAT:",
+ "Optionally stores the first status byte. $30 '0' = OK. $38 '8' = 84 REU NOT ENABLED or 85 FILE NOT OPENED. $FF = no status seen (no Ultimate, or no reply).": "可选地保存第一个状态字节。$30 '0' = 成功。$38 '8' = 84 REU 未启用 或 85 文件未打开。$FF = 未收到状态 (没有 Ultimate 或无回应)。",
+ "FLOW:": "流程:",
+ "Falls through to the next node on every path, including when no Ultimate is present.": "在所有路径上都会继续执行下一个节点, 包括没有 Ultimate 的情况。",
+ "Copies a byte range [src_start..src_end) to a destination address at runtime.": "在运行时把字节范围 [src_start..src_end) 复制到目标地址。",
+ "Unrolled inline for 8 bytes or fewer, otherwise a page-aware loop (capped at 1024 bytes).": "8 字节及以下时内联展开, 否则使用感知分页的循环 (上限 1024 字节)。",
+ "WARNING:": "警告:",
+ "Forward copy only - overlapping ranges where the destination is above the source will corrupt data.": "仅向前复制 - 目标高于源的重叠范围会破坏数据。",
+ "Declares one raster interrupt: the line it fires on, and optionally a JSR into SID music playback.": "声明一个光栅中断: 触发的行, 以及可选的 SID 音乐播放 JSR。",
+ "LABELS:": "标签:",
+ "Exposes two labels other nodes can JSR to: the handler entry point, and an init routine that hooks the vector.": "提供两个可供其他节点 JSR 的标签: 处理程序入口, 以及挂接向量的初始化例程。",
+ "An IRQ HANDLER elsewhere on the spine to dispatch to it.": "主干上其他位置需要一个 IRQ HANDLER 来分派到它。",
+ "Reads every connected IRQ node, sorts them by raster line, builds the raster / target lookup tables, and emits a self-modifying JSR dispatch handler.": "读取所有连接的 IRQ 节点, 按光栅行排序, 构建光栅 / 目标查找表, 并生成自修改的 JSR 分派处理程序。",
+ "KERNAL-chained ($0314/$0315) or the direct hardware vector ($FFFE/$FFFF).": "KERNAL 链接 ($0314/$0315) 或直接硬件向量 ($FFFE/$FFFF)。",
+ "A freeform block of hand-written 6502 assembly, assembled inline exactly where the node sits on the spine.": "自由编写的 6502 汇编代码块, 精确地在节点位于主干上的位置内联汇编。",
+ "The escape hatch for anything the macro library doesn't cover yet - labels, opcodes and directives all work as normal.": "用于宏库尚未覆盖的任何内容 - 标签、操作码和伪指令都可正常使用。",
+ "Loads one file from a LOAD_ORG D64 image on demand.": "按需从 LOAD_ORG D64 映像载入一个文件。",
+ "KERNAL SETLFS / SETNAM / LOAD with secondary address $01, so the file loads to the address in its own PRG header.": "使用二级地址 $01 调用 KERNAL SETLFS / SETNAM / LOAD, 因此文件载入到其 PRG 头中的地址。",
+ "Call it wherever it's needed on the spine - there's no fixed load-order requirement.": "可在主干上任何需要的地方调用 - 没有固定的载入顺序要求。",
+ "Loads a save file from a LOAD_ORG D64 back into RAM at runtime, restoring whatever it holds.": "在运行时从 LOAD_ORG D64 把存档文件载回 RAM, 恢复其中的内容。",
+ "A BYTE_DATA asset with USE AS SAVE FILE enabled and linked into the LOAD_ORG. That block is where your persisted VARs live - lives, coins, stats, or anything else you want to survive a reset.": "一个启用了 USE AS SAVE FILE 并链接到 LOAD_ORG 的 BYTE_DATA 资源。该块就是保存持久化 VAR 的地方 - 生命、金币、统计, 或任何你希望在重置后保留的内容。",
+ "Writes a BYTE_DATA asset's current contents to disk via a LOAD_ORG D64, persisting it between sessions.": "通过 LOAD_ORG D64 把 BYTE_DATA 资源的当前内容写入磁盘, 在多次运行之间保留。",
+ "The asset must have USE AS SAVE FILE enabled and be linked into the LOAD_ORG. That's the block your game's persistent VARs (lives, coins, stats, etc.) should read from and write to.": "该资源必须启用 USE AS SAVE FILE 并链接到 LOAD_ORG。游戏的持久化 VAR (生命、金币、统计等) 应从该块读取并写入。",
+ "DMA transfer between C64 RAM and REU RAM, via registers $DF00-$DF0A.": "通过寄存器 $DF00-$DF0A 在 C64 RAM 与 REU RAM 之间进行 DMA 传输。",
+ "STASH copies C64 -> REU. FETCH copies REU -> C64. SWAP exchanges both directions. COMPARE verifies only, with no write.": "STASH 复制 C64 -> REU。FETCH 复制 REU -> C64。SWAP 双向交换。COMPARE 仅校验, 不写入。",
+ "ADDRESSES:": "地址:",
+ "C64 is the 16-bit start address in C64 RAM. REU is the 16-bit start address in REU RAM. BANK is the REU bank, 0-255 (most units: bank 0 only). LEN is the bytes to move; $0000 = 65536.": "C64 是 C64 RAM 中的 16 位起始地址。REU 是 REU RAM 中的 16 位起始地址。BANK 是 REU 存储体, 0-255 (大多数设备只有存储体 0)。LEN 是要移动的字节数; $0000 = 65536。",
+ "AUTOLOAD:": "AUTOLOAD:",
+ "Reloads the start addresses once the transfer finishes, so the node can fire again without re-setting anything.": "传输完成后重新载入起始地址, 因此节点无需重新设置即可再次触发。",
+ "FIX C64 / FIX REU:": "FIX C64 / FIX REU:",
+ "Hold that side's address still during the transfer - use for fills or repeated single-byte reads and writes.": "在传输期间保持该侧地址不变 - 用于填充或重复的单字节读写。",
+ "FF00-disable is always set on the command byte: without it, a stray write to $FF00 can re-trigger the last queued transfer.": "命令字节上总是设置 FF00 禁用位: 否则对 $FF00 的意外写入可能重新触发最后排队的传输。"
 }
